	I have heard tell that hanging on to daggers brings the
ability to carry greater weight.  Supposedly, though this is second
hand, a person was able to carry almost infinite weight (i.e. throw
boulders, etc.) because he found thousands of daggers someplace.
True? 

Also, I thought I might bring tears of remembrance and reminiscence to
some of your eyes:
	Think back to your early days of hacking, when you took for
granted that things weren't cursed, when you wouldn't ever think of 
dropping them on an altar - Did any of you ever die KICKING A BOX? I
only say this because it happened to me, and it makes a pretty funny
picture - some poor guy, his leg broken and bleeding, kicking again
and keeling over "Akkkk * (<- comic reference).  Weren't those days
fun?  :)

